acceptance_criteria: "Public contract data distinguishes root-only flags from enforced inherited subcommand reservations; Blueprint lint, runtime activation, and package author checks consume the same documented scope; Packed extension tests exercise root --explain and command-local --explain without dropping healthy sibling commands; Any compatibility change has an explicit migration contract and does not silently quarantine existing valid packages"
value: Reduce recovery ambiguity and preserve trustworthy project context for agents
